msgctxt "284"
msgid "It's you! You're part of the Ryudo Family, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"Boy, am I glad to see you! I can't handle this alone, so I was thinking of "
"askin' Nakahara-san a favor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Sorry to break it to you, but I'm not in the Ryudo Family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"But I could have sworn I saw you step into Nakahara-san's office the other "
"day with Rikiya-kun and his pal..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Well, I can't deny that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Then you and Nakahara-san are at least acquainted, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "I have a big favor to ask you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "I have a feeling I'm not gonna like this, but go ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "First off, my name's Takeshi Kyan, and I run the Public Market here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"Lately, there have been some black market deals going down here. It's been "
"causing us some trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Black market? What kind of deals, exactly?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Iriomote wildcat trafficking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Cats?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"That's right. The Iriomote wildcat's an endangered species protected by law,"
" and it's only found in Okinawa!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"A few dedicated collectors are willing to pay dealers insane amounts of "
"money for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "And they've been making deals here, in your market."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"That's right. But I don't have the expertise needed to bring these criminals"
" to justice on my own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "Haven't you contacted the police?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"I can't do that. If I get the law involved, and they figure out there are "
"shady deals going on at my market..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "They'd shut us down! For days! Think of all the business we'd lose!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"I won't have it! As the Public Market's president, I have to get this solved"
" without closing us down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"I'd be willing to pay for your trouble! You'd be really helping us locals "
"out. What do you say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"This is a job for local law enforcement. Endangered species are protected by"
" law, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"That's true, but think about it... This is a popular tourist spot. With "
"scandals, and police... our image would suffer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid ""
"And that means our businesses would suffer. As president of the Public "
"Market, I have a duty to solve this peacefully."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid ""
"All the more reason to ask the cops. They know how to handle this stuff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "All right, I'll help."
msgstr "[Va bene. Aiuterò.]"

msgctxt "632"
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr "Grazie!"

msgctxt "644"
msgid "So what exactly do I have to do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Actually, my biggest suspect is on the second floor as we speak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "You've already got a suspect picked out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "Yes. He's a fat man with a green hat and a red Hawaiian shirt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid ""
"He always shows up in those clothes whenever an Iriomote wildcat deal is "
"going down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid ""
"A fat man with a green hat and a red Hawaiian shirt. Anything else I should "
"know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "Yes. He's always carrying a big cage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "A cage?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "You know, like a carrier. The kind people carry pets in?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "He probably keeps the wildcats in there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid ""
"Then all I have to do is look in the cage to know if he's guilty, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"Well, you'd think so... But I thought I caught him red-handed once. When I "
"looked in the cage, it was empty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "Empty, eh...? So you caught him after the deal had already gone down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid ""
"Could be. But there's no point in catching the bastard without any evidence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "Please, catch him before he makes the deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr "Capito."

msgctxt "836"
msgid "Good luck to you! I'll be waiting right here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid "Kiryu-san! You came back for me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid ""
"I'm begging you to help me out here! You'd be saving our community! So...?"
